  "reason": "RNA-only multiprofile models are the strongest evidence so far, with scvi_n200 + transformer slightly ahead of scvi_n200 + avgpool, while pca_n2000 + avgpool is clearly lower. The missing pca_n2000 + transformer point would clarify whether the small transformer advantage is general or specific to scvi_n200, completing a clean comparison of RNA encoder and aggregation. This is a focused, single-factor extension of the strongest direction and is more informative now than moving to multimodal fusion, since image-only ResNet50 is weak and multimodal tests would change multiple design choices at once."
}

